(6986796, 1054144, 62318, '<td valign="top">I actually didn''t care for this shot. I gave you a five. I would have given you a 2 for a DMNC if I would have known. <br/>Nothing connects with the viewer. It is quite haphazard. <br/> <br/>It''s almost like you just pointed your camera at people and just pushed the button. <br/>And that''s fine, if you wanted something at this moment in time. <br/>It''s actually good if you were looking.<br/>Hopefully this photo was for the challenge... or at least a photo that you knew you wanted. <br/>I don''t see that here. <br/>Maybe you can convince me, photographically speaking what you were trying to get?<br/> <br/>And of course, I might be a little dense to understand.</td>', 'I actually didn''t care for this shot. I gave you a five. I would have given you a 2 for a DMNC if I would have known. Nothing connects with the viewer. It is quite haphazard.  It''s almost like you just pointed your camera at people and just pushed the button. And that''s fine, if you wanted something at this moment in time. It''s actually good if you were looking.Hopefully this photo was for the challenge... or at least a photo that you knew you wanted. I don''t see that here. Maybe you can convince me, photographically speaking what you were trying to get? And of course, I might be a little dense to understand.', '2013-02-27 00:26:02.000000', NULL, 0),
