(6986908, 1054001, 140537, '<td valign="top">Love it. I had the same idea, but this much is better executed. I like your choice to look off camera. Love the detail in the ceiling, the sangles and curves and how it contrasts with the blur of the passers by.<br/>Crowd sized didn''t seem to matter. At times I had tons of folks. They got out of the way and created a path around me. If I moved the camera back and the crowd was large, you couldn''t see me.</td>', 'Love it. I had the same idea, but this much is better executed. I like your choice to look off camera. Love the detail in the ceiling, the sangles and curves and how it contrasts with the blur of the passers by.Crowd sized didn''t seem to matter. At times I had tons of folks. They got out of the way and created a path around me. If I moved the camera back and the crowd was large, you couldn''t see me.', '2013-02-27 03:38:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6986910, 1054140, 20799, '<td valign="top">Michelle? You were <strike>one of</strike> my highest pick<strike>s</strike>! This is just beautiful, reminds me of Clive''s work. <br/>Congrats on the PH bling!<br/> <br/>ETA: checked my votes :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-02-27 11:20:07.</i></td>', 'Michelle? You were one of my highest picks! This is just beautiful, reminds me of Clive''s work. Congrats on the PH bling! ETA: checked my votes :)', '2013-02-27 03:46:42.000000', '2013-02-27 11:20:07.000000', 0),
(6986911, 1053838, 100495, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the votes/comments.<br/> <br/>The Shambles is the prettiest street in the heart of medieval York so it seemed appropriate to use the name as a title. For about 15 minutes a day the sun shines directly down it providing dramatic strong lighting.<br/> <br/>Genuine self-portrait using my new off-board flash to balance the strong backlight (who says you don''t need good kit to get good results?). I had a better shot but I really love the natural golden hue from the winter sun in this shot.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-02-27 16:48:11.</i></td>', 'Thanks for the votes/comments. The Shambles is the prettiest street in the heart of medieval York so it seemed appropriate to use the name as a title. For about 15 minutes a day the sun shines directly down it providing dramatic strong lighting. Genuine self-portrait using my new off-board flash to balance the strong backlight (who says you don''t need good kit to get good results?). I had a better shot but I really love the natural golden hue from the winter sun in this shot.', '2013-02-27 03:50:42.000000', '2013-02-27 16:48:11.000000', 0),
